<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-AUSTRALIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-AUSTRALIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores in the</p>
<p>Australian Open at the par-72 Australian Golf Club course on</p>
<p>Thursday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>67 Greg Norman</p>
<p>68 Klas Eriksson (Sweden)</p>
<p>69 Robert Stephens</p>
<p>70 Brett Partridge, David Howell (Britain), Wayne Grady,</p>
<p>Richard Green</p>
<p>71 Rodger Davis, Rolf Muntz (Netherlands)</p>
<p>72 Adrian Percey, Grant Waite (New Zealand), Anthony Painter,</p>
<p>Jean-Louis Guepy (France), David Smail (New Zealand), Justin</p>
<p>Cooper,</p>
<p>Paul Marshall, Steve Alker (New Zealand)</p>
<p>73 Brad Lamb, Stephen Leaney, Terry Price, Craig Warren, Craig</p>
<p>Jones,</p>
<p>Jerry Kelly (U.S.), David Gleeson, Michael Clayton, Jason</p>
<p>Evans</p>
<p>Other selected scores:</p>
<p>74 Robin Byrd (U.S.)</p>
<p>75 Michael Long (New Zealand)</p>
<p>76 Wayne Riley, Richard Boxall (Britain)</p>
<p>77 Peter Senior, Robert Allenby</p>
<p>78 Peter Lonard, Peter O'Malley</p>
<p>79 Tiger Woods (U.S.)</p>
</text>
